      "content": "human spirit doesn't change the fact that everything is just losing energy. i'm exhausted from trying to 'rewrite destiny' against a current that's clearly too strong. honestly, sometimes it feels like the only way to actually stop the decay, to stop the constant failure and the dragging weight of it all, is to just let the descent finish. to just... exit the equation entirely so the entropy doesn't have to deal with me anymore. is that even rational? to just stop fighting the inevitable?",
